comment: Rationale for assigning this type to reference data: Mapping of this cell set to a purkinje layer interneuron is supported by spatial location in the purkinje cell layer of the cerebellum Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
