def: "A hippocampal CA1-3 neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Il16 (Mmus), Ramp3 (Mmus), Gria1 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0101 CA2-FC-IG Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, CA2-FC-IG Glut_2 does not have cells in field ca2 (CA2). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
