id: PCL:0110120
name: OT D3 Folh1 Gaba Islands of Calleja granule cell (Mmus)
def: "A Islands of Calleja granule cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Drd3 (Mmus), Prok2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Subclass:060 OT D3 Folh1 Gaba." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-023-42662-z; https\://doi.org/10.1038/s41593-021-00952-z, https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Rationale for assigning this type to reference data: Mapping of this cell type is corroborated by spatial location, expression of Drd3, Drd1 and Gad1/2. Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. {xref="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-023-42662-z; https://doi.org/10.1038/s41593-021-00952-z"}
