name: L6b CTX Glut_3 L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ccn2 (Mmus), Olfr111 (Mmus), Adgrg6 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0112 L6b CTX Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
