[Term]
id: PCL:0110910
name: MEA-BST Sox6 Gaba_4 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Bcl11b (Mmus), Kcng1 (Mmus), Cxcl14 (Mmus), Csmd3 (Mmus), Arx (Mmus), Sox6 (Mmus), Npy1r (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0340 MEA-BST Sox6 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, MEA-BST Sox6 Gaba_4 does not have cells in bed nuclei of the stria terminalis (BST). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
