[Term]
id: PCL:0110980
name: BST Tac2 Gaba_2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pou3f3 (Mmus), Slc32a1 (Mmus), Spata13 (Mmus), Crh (Mmus), C1ql3 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0410 BST Tac2 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
