id: PCL:0111021
name: AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Prdm12 (Mmus), Cdh23 (Mmus), Sox2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0451 AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
