[Term]
id: PCL:0111039
name: ZI Pax6 Gaba_11 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc32a1 (Mmus), Dpf3 (Mmus), Lhx1os (Mmus), Zic1 (Mmus), Cnih3 (Mmus), Pou6f2 (Mmus), Pax6 (Mmus), Mdga1 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0469 ZI Pax6 Gaba_11." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06808-9, https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
