id: PCL:0111055
name: PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_4 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Apoc3 (Mmus), Oprd1 (Mmus), Csta2 (Mmus), Isl1 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0485 PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_4 does not have cells in ventromedial preoptic nucleus (VMPO). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
