comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: This type SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_12 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for subparafascicular area (SPA), subparafascicular nucleus, magnocellular part (SPFm), subparafascicular nucleus, parvicellular part (SPFp), posterior limiting nucleus of the thalamus (POL), posterior intralaminar thalamic nucleus (PIL), posterior triangular thalamic nucleus (PoT). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0729 SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_12" EXACT []
