[Term]
id: PCL:0111404
name: LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Nkx2-2 (Mmus), Emx2 (Mmus), Scn5a (Mmus), Tcf7l2 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0834 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_1 does not have cells in subparafascicular nucleus, parvicellular part (SPFp). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0834 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_1" EXACT []
