comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, PRP-NI-PRNc-GRN Otp Glut_1 does not have cells in nucleus incertus (NI), pontine reticular nucleus, caudal part (PRNc). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0955 PRP-NI-PRNc-GRN Otp Glut_1" EXACT []
