def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of A330102I10Rik (Mmus), Mab21l1 (Mmus), Tmem132c (Mmus), Meis2 (Mmus), Nr2f2 (Mmus), Phox2b (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:0968 NTS Phox2b Glut_10." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
