comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba_2 does not have cells in nucleus raphe pontis (RPO). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
