[Term]
id: PCL:0111621
name: LDT-DTN Gata3 Nfix Gaba_2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lrrc38 (Mmus), Jag1 (Mmus), Sp9 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1051 LDT-DTN Gata3 Nfix Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, LDT-DTN Gata3 Nfix Gaba_2 does not have cells in dorsal tegmental nucleus (DTN). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1051 LDT-DTN Gata3 Nfix Gaba_2" EXACT []
