[Term]
id: PCL:0111622
name: NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gata2 (Mmus), Nr4a3 (Mmus), Glp1r (Mmus), Gm29683 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1052 NI-RPO Gata3 Nr4a2 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06808-9, https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
