[Term]
id: PCL:0111659
name: MY Lhx1 Gly-Gaba_1 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Syt6 (Mmus), Kazald1 (Mmus), Pax2 (Mmus), Lhx1os (Mmus), Tmem132d (Mmus), G630016G05Rik (Mmus), Myo16 (Mmus), Syt2 (Mmus), Zfhx4 (Mmus), Slc6a5 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1089 MY Lhx1 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
