def: "A GABA-Gly neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Arg1 (Mmus), Neurog2 (Mmus), Zic5 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1105 NTS-MDRNd Prox1 Zic1 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, NTS-MDRNd Prox1 Zic1 Gly-Gaba_1 does not have cells in medullary reticular nucleus, dorsal part (MDRNd). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1105 NTS-MDRNd Prox1 Zic1 Gly-Gaba_1" EXACT []
