id: PCL:0111702
name: NTS-PARN Neurod2 Gly-Gaba_3 GABA-Gly neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABA-Gly neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Bcl11b (Mmus), C130026L21Rik (Mmus), Pax8 (Mmus), Neurod6 (Mmus), Gm20646 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1132 NTS-PARN Neurod2 Gly-Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06808-9, https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
