[Term]
id: PCL:0111739
name: Astroependymal NN_1 cell (Mmus)
def: "A cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gfap (Mmus), Cnmd (Mmus), Id1 (Mmus), Fabp7 (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1169 Astroependymal NN_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
