name: L4/5 IT CTX Glut_2 Rab37 L4/5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L4/5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ddit4l (Mmus), Hspb3 (Mmus), Pld5 (Mmus), Fign (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L4/5 IT CTX Glut_2 cells by expression of Rab37, Maf, 4930447N08Rik, Hgf, Tox. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Orbital area, lateral part, layer 2/3, Primary motor area, Layer 2/3, Secondary motor area, layer 2/3 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0078 L4/5 IT CTX Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
