[Term]
id: PCL:0112468
name: L4/5 IT CTX Glut_3 Gm10635 L4/5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L4/5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm10635 (Mmus), Gm20752 (Mmus), Cyp26b1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L4/5 IT CTX Glut_3 cells by expression of Gm10635, Cyp26b1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Primary motor area, Layer 2/3, Secondary motor area, layer 2/3 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0088 L4/5 IT CTX Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
