id: PCL:0112469
name: L4/5 IT CTX Glut_4 Reln L4/5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L4/5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm34567 (Mmus), Met (Mmus), Reln (Mmus), Ovol2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L4/5 IT CTX Glut_4 cells by expression of Reln, Met, Gm34567. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Temporal association areas, layer 2/3, Gustatory areas, layer 2/3, Ectorhinal area/Layer 2/3, Supplemental somatosensory area, layer 2/3 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0089 L4/5 IT CTX Glut_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
