name: L2/3 IT CTX Glut_2 Cbln4 L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Stard8 (Mmus), Satb2 (Mmus), Ddit4l (Mmus), Klhl1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT CTX Glut_2 cells by expression of Cbln4, Tmem215. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Secondary motor area, layer 1 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0109 L2/3 IT CTX Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
