id: PCL:0112500
name: L2/3 IT CTX Glut_4 Sv2c L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Retn (Mmus), Adam2 (Mmus), Glis3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT CTX Glut_4 cells by expression of Sv2c, Slc1a3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Visceral area, layer 2/3, Agranular insular area, posterior part, layer 2/3, Ectorhinal area/Layer 2/3 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0120 L2/3 IT CTX Glut_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
synonym: "0120 L2/3 IT CTX Glut_4" EXACT []
