id: PCL:0112501
name: L2/3 IT ENT Glut_1 Tgfbr2 L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm34466 (Mmus), Cd44 (Mmus), Tgfbr2 (Mmus), Ntsr1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT ENT Glut_1 cells by expression of Tgfbr2, Ntsr1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas, Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 5, Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 3, Postpiriform transition area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0121 L2/3 IT ENT Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
