def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cyp26b1 (Mmus), Olfm4 (Mmus), Unc5d (Mmus), Chrm2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT ENT Glut_1 cells by expression of Cyp26b1, Olfm4, Chrm2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas, Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 5, Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 6a, Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 3 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0122 L2/3 IT ENT Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
