[Term]
id: PCL:0112507
name: L2/3 IT ENT Glut_3 Igfbp6 L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Igfn1 (Mmus), Pdyn (Mmus), Zar1l (Mmus), Qrfpr (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT ENT Glut_3 cells by expression of Igfbp6. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex, Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 2, Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 3 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0127 L2/3 IT ENT Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
