def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Igfn1 (Mmus), Ndst4 (Mmus), Cxcl14 (Mmus), Abi3bp (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT PIR-ENTl Glut_3 cells by expression of Bdnf, Hs3st2, Abi3bp, Pou3f2, Igfn1, C730002L08Rik. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex, Olfactory areas , in or close to the regions: Piriform area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0150 L2/3 IT PIR-ENTl Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
