def: "A intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sebox (Mmus), Ndnf (Mmus), Bmpr1b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other IT AON-TT-DP Glut_1 cells by expression of Sebox, Ndnf. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex, Olfactory areas , in or close to the regions: Taenia tecta, dorsal part, Dorsal peduncular area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0167 IT AON-TT-DP Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
