def: "A L2 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Olfr316 (Mmus), Lef1 (Mmus), Usp43 (Mmus), Cbln1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2 IT ENT-po Glut_1 cells by expression of Egln3, Glra3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 1, Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 2, Entorhinal area, medial part, dorsal zone, layer 1 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0186 L2 IT ENT-po Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
