id: PCL:0112582
name: MEA Slc17a7 Glut_2 Car8 cerebral cortex neuron (Mmus)
def: "A cerebral cortex neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sim1 (Mmus), Lyzl4 (Mmus), Plekhd1 (Mmus), Galr1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MEA Slc17a7 Glut_2 cells by expression of Car8, Galr1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Cortical subplate, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Basomedial amygdalar nucleus, anterior part, Medial amygdalar nucleus, Central amygdalar nucleus, medial part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0202 MEA Slc17a7 Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
