[Term]
id: PCL:0112596
name: COAp Grxcr2 Glut_2 Prokr2 cerebral cortex neuron (Mmus)
def: "A cerebral cortex neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 1700018A04Rik (Mmus), Tmem215 (Mmus), Trh (Mmus). It is distinguished from other COAp Grxcr2 Glut_2 cells by expression of Prokr2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas , in or close to the regions: Cortical amygdalar area, posterior part, lateral zone, Piriform-amygdalar area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0216 COAp Grxcr2 Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
