def: "A hippocampal CA1-3 neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dcn (Mmus), Apela (Mmus), Mafb (Mmus), Dlk1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CA1-ProS Glut_3 cells by expression of Pxdc1, Bmp2, Col23a1, Satb2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Field CA1, stratum oriens, Field CA1, stratum radiatum . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0281 CA1-ProS Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
