[Term]
id: PCL:0112721
name: L2/3 IT PPP Glut_3 Sulf1 L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L2/3 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ntn5 (Mmus), Itga1 (Mmus), Gfra2 (Mmus), Lrrc4c (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L2/3 IT PPP Glut_3 cells by expression of Sulf1, Slc17a6. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Retrohippocampal region, brain , in or close to the regions: Presubiculum, Area prostriata, Parasubiculum . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0341 L2/3 IT PPP Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
