[Term]
id: PCL:0112729
name: L5 ET CTX Glut_1 Cacng4 L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Otx1 (Mmus), Egln3 (Mmus), Stac (Mmus), Atp10a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L5 ET CTX Glut_1 cells by expression of Cacng4, Stac. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Agranular insular area, dorsal part, layer 5, Prelimbic area, layer 5, Orbital area, medial part, layer 5 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0349 L5 ET CTX Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
