name: L5 ET CTX Glut_1 Diaph3 L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm6260 (Mmus), Igfbp4 (Mmus), Diaph3 (Mmus), Lamp5 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L5 ET CTX Glut_1 cells by expression of Diaph3, Stk17b, Fstl5, Adra1b. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Anterior cingulate area, dorsal part, layer 5, Anterior cingulate area, ventral part, layer 5, Secondary motor area, layer 2/3 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0352 L5 ET CTX Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
