id: PCL:0112743
name: L5 ET CTX Glut_2 Cped1 L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm6260 (Mmus), Plekha2 (Mmus), Kcnh7 (Mmus), Lhx2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L5 ET CTX Glut_2 cells by expression of Cped1, Ndnf, Gm11549. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Anterior cingulate area, dorsal part, layer 5, Secondary motor area, layer 5, Anterior cingulate area, ventral part, layer 5, Retrosplenial area, lateral agranular part, layer 5 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0363 L5 ET CTX Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
