def: "A L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm6260 (Mmus), Ndnf (Mmus), Pcp4 (Mmus), Hpgd (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L5 ET CTX Glut_5 cells by expression of Hpgd, Ndnf. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Agranular insular area, dorsal part, layer 5, Orbital area, medial part, layer 5, Agranular insular area, ventral part, layer 5 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0377 L5 ET CTX Glut_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
