id: PCL:0112759
name: L5 ET CTX Glut_6 Arhgap28 L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L5 extratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm6260 (Mmus), Arhgap28 (Mmus), Qrfpr (Mmus), Met (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L5 ET CTX Glut_6 cells by expression of Arhgap28, Qrfpr, Met. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Retrosplenial area, ventral part, layer 2/3, Retrosplenial area, dorsal part, layer 5, Retrosplenial area, ventral part, layer 5, Retrosplenial area, lateral agranular part, layer 5 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0379 L5 ET CTX Glut_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
