def: "A L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ccn2 (Mmus), Fgf16 (Mmus), Meis2 (Mmus), Layn (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L6b EPd Glut_3 cells by expression of Chst15, Col23a1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Cortical subplate , in or close to the regions: Claustrum, Endopiriform nucleus, dorsal part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0408 L6b EPd Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
