def: "A L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lefty2 (Mmus), Il1rapl2 (Mmus), Dmrt2 (Mmus), Htr2a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L6b/CT ENT Glut_1 cells by expression of Otx1, Rprm. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Entorhinal area, lateral part, layer 6a, Entorhinal area, medial part, dorsal zone, layer 6 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0412 L6b/CT ENT Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
