id: PCL:0112798
name: L6b/CT ENT Glut_3 Chrnb3 L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron (Mmus)
def: "A L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 9430014N10Rik (Mmus), Chrnb3 (Mmus), Moxd1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L6b/CT ENT Glut_3 cells by expression of Chrnb3, Tmem40. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex, Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Postsubiculum, Subiculum, Entorhinal area, medial part, dorsal zone, layer 6 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0418 L6b/CT ENT Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
