def: "A L6b glutamatergic cortical neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Krt80 (Mmus), Gpr139 (Mmus), Gm10635 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other L6 CT CTX Glut_5 cells by expression of Gpr139, Gm10635. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Secondary motor area, layer 6a, Prelimbic area, layer 6a, Primary motor area, Layer 6a, Anterior cingulate area, dorsal part, layer 6a . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0456 L6 CT CTX Glut_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
