def: "A hippocampal neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pirt (Mmus), Fn1 (Mmus), Cadps2 (Mmus), Htr4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NP SUB Glut_2 cells by expression of Cobll1, Htr4. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a7, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Presubiculum, Subiculum . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0480 NP SUB Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
