def: "A cerebral cortex neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 4930523C07Rik (Mmus), Gm38505 (Mmus), Reln (Mmus). It is distinguished from other OB Meis2 Thsd7b Gaba_1 cells by expression of Plce1, Cntnap5c, Reln. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas , in or close to the regions: Piriform area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0518 OB Meis2 Thsd7b Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
