name: OB Dopa-Gaba_1 AW551984 cerebral cortex neuron (Mmus)
def: "A cerebral cortex neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gpr174 (Mmus), Gal (Mmus), 9330158H04Rik (Mmus). It is distinguished from other OB Dopa-Gaba_1 cells by expression of Gal, AW551984. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Slc32a1, Th, Slc18a2, Slc6a3, Gad2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas, brain , in or close to the regions: olfactory nerve layer of main olfactory bulb, Main olfactory bulb . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0583 OB Dopa-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
