[Term]
id: PCL:0113003
name: Vip Gaba_1 Barx2 VIP GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A VIP GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vip (Mmus), Cobll1 (Mmus), Crh (Mmus), Tac2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Vip Gaba_1 cells by expression of Barx2, Crh, Tac2. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0623 Vip Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
