name: Vip Gaba_2 Cbln4 VIP GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A VIP GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vip (Mmus), Pdgfra (Mmus), Cbln4 (Mmus), Crh (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Vip Gaba_2 cells by expression of Pdgfra, Cbln4, Crh. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Secondary motor area, layer 1 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0629 Vip Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
