[Term]
id: PCL:0113017
name: Vip Gaba_4 Gpr101 VIP GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A VIP GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vip (Mmus), Qrfpr (Mmus), Gpr101 (Mmus), Ccbe1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Vip Gaba_4 cells by expression of Gpr101, Ror2. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, Olfactory areas, Retrohippocampal region, Isocortex, Cortical subplate . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0637 Vip Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
