def: "A VIP GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Aqp5 (Mmus), Mybpc1 (Mmus), Col25a1 (Mmus), Drd1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Vip Gaba_6 cells by expression of Mybpc1, Npy, Drd1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex, Retrohippocampal region . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0647 Vip Gaba_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
