id: PCL:0113029
name: Vip Gaba_7 Myl1 VIP GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A VIP GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vip (Mmus), Myl1 (Mmus), Stk32a (Mmus), Igfbp7 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Vip Gaba_7 cells by expression of Myl1, Stk32a, Igfbp7, Npffr1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, Cortical subplate , in or close to the regions: Field CA1, stratum radiatum, Field CA3, stratum oriens . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0649 Vip Gaba_7." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
