[Term]
id: PCL:0113042
name: Vip Gaba_12 Krt12 VIP GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A VIP GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vip (Mmus), Rgs5 (Mmus), Cort (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Vip Gaba_12 cells by expression of Krt12, Sp9. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0662 Vip Gaba_12." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
