id: PCL:0113051
name: Sncg Gaba_2 Spon1 sncg GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A sncg GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Col14a1 (Mmus), Thbs2 (Mmus), Htr3a (Mmus), Clrn1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Sncg Gaba_2 cells by expression of Spon1, Ror1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0671 Sncg Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
