[Term]
id: PCL:0113075
name: RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3 Plch1 caudal ganglionic eminence derived interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A caudal ganglionic eminence derived interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ibsp (Mmus), Wif1 (Mmus), Cxcl14 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3 cells by expression of Plch1, Ndnf. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Field CA1, stratum lacunosum-moleculare, Field CA1, stratum radiatum . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0695 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3 Plch1 does not have cells in cortical amygdalar area (COA). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "0695 RHP-COA Ndnf Gaba_3" EXACT []
