def: "A lamp5 GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sln (Mmus), Lamp5 (Mmus), Rxfp1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Lamp5 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Sln, Has2os, Cxcl14. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex, Retrohippocampal region, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0706 Lamp5 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
