id: PCL:0113089
name: Lamp5 Gaba_1 Rasl11a lamp5 GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A lamp5 GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cplx3 (Mmus), Rasl11a (Mmus), Rassf2 (Mmus), Hs6st3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Lamp5 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Rasl11a, Hs6st3. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0709 Lamp5 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
