def: "A lamp5 GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Col14a1 (Mmus), Krt73 (Mmus), Tgfbi (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Lamp5 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Krt73. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0722 Lamp5 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
