id: PCL:0113104
name: Lamp5 Lhx6 Gaba_1 Fstl4 Lamp5 Lhx6 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A Lamp5 Lhx6 neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Egfr (Mmus), Lhx6 (Mmus), Ccn3 (Mmus), Fstl4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Lamp5 Lhx6 Gaba cells by expression of Fstl4. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, Isocortex, Retrohippocampal region, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0724 Lamp5 Lhx6 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
