name: Lamp5 Lhx6 Gaba_1 Rmst Lamp5 Lhx6 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A Lamp5 Lhx6 neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cort (Mmus), Col5a2 (Mmus), Gm31218 (Mmus), Pde11a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Lamp5 Lhx6 Gaba cells by expression of Rmst. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, Olfactory areas, Cortical subplate, Retrohippocampal region , in or close to the regions: Field CA1, stratum radiatum . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0725 Lamp5 Lhx6 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
