def: "A Lamp5 Lhx6 neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Baiap2l2 (Mmus), Mctp2 (Mmus), Dgkk (Mmus), Nmbr (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Lamp5 Lhx6 Gaba cells by expression of Dgkk, Nmbr. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, Isocortex , in or close to the regions: Dentate gyrus, molecular layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0726 Lamp5 Lhx6 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
