[Term]
id: PCL:0113112
name: Pvalb chandelier Gaba_1 Ntf3 pvalb chandelier GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A pvalb chandelier GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Adamts8 (Mmus), Pde11a (Mmus), Rxfp3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Pvalb chandelier Gaba cells by expression of Ntf3. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, brain , in or close to the regions: Field CA1, stratum oriens, Field CA3, stratum oriens . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0732 Pvalb chandelier Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
