def: "A pvalb GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm16685 (Mmus), Rbp4 (Mmus), Gpc4 (Mmus), Col24a1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Pvalb Gaba_1 cells by expression of Il7, Col24a1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Th). These cells are located in the Isocortex . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0735 Pvalb Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
