id: PCL:0113144
name: Sst Gaba_2 Htr1d sst GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A sst GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Moxd1 (Mmus), Edaradd (Mmus), Ecel1 (Mmus), Htr1d (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Sst Gaba_2 cells by expression of Htr1d, Drd1, Prokr2, Gpc3. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas, Cortical subplate , in or close to the regions: Basomedial amygdalar nucleus, posterior part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0764 Sst Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
