name: Sst Gaba_7 Cdk15 sst GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A sst GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Akr1c18 (Mmus), Hpse (Mmus), Stk32b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Sst Gaba_7 cells by expression of Cdk15, Hpse, Klhl14. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Isocortex . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0793 Sst Gaba_7." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
