id: PCL:0113228
name: Sst Chodl Gaba_1 Fign sst chodl GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A sst chodl GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Spag17 (Mmus), Lhx8 (Mmus), Fbn2 (Mmus), Ntn1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Sst Chodl Gaba_1 cells by expression of Fign, Ntn1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Olfactory areas, Pallidum, brain , in or close to the regions: Magnocellular nucleus, Substantia innominata . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0848 Sst Chodl Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
