def: "A medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Stx11 (Mmus), Gm12128 (Mmus), Calb2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Gm12128, Sla. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Magnocellular nucleus, Substantia innominata, Piriform area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0877 NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
