def: "A medial ganglionic eminence derived interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lhx8 (Mmus), Npsr1 (Mmus), Frem3 (Mmus), Zfp536 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba cells by expression of Frem3, Zfp536. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Anterior amygdalar area, Substantia innominata . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:0917 NDB-SI-MA-STRv Lhx8 Gaba_13." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
