id: PCL:0113392
name: STR-PAL Chst9 Gaba_4 Nptx2 lateral ganglionic eminence derived neuron (Mmus)
def: "A lateral ganglionic eminence derived neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Baz1a (Mmus), A730046J19Rik (Mmus), Penk (Mmus), Pdyn (Mmus). It is distinguished from other STR-PAL Chst9 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Nptx2, Adcy8. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Cortical subplate, brain , in or close to the regions: Striatum, Central amygdalar nucleus, capsular part, Central amygdalar nucleus, medial part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1012 STR-PAL Chst9 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
synonym: "1012 STR-PAL Chst9 Gaba_4" EXACT []
