def: "A striatum neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Prdm12 (Mmus), Foxp2 (Mmus), Adam18 (Mmus), Fbn2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LSX Prdm12 Slit2 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Ndst4, Pde3a, Adarb2, Tox. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Lateral septal complex , in or close to the regions: Lateral septal nucleus, rostral (rostroventral) part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1121 LSX Prdm12 Slit2 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
synonym: "1121 LSX Prdm12 Slit2 Gaba_1" EXACT []
