[Term]
id: PCL:0113558
name: LSX Sall3 Lmo1 Gaba_2 Igfbpl1 striatum neuron (Mmus)
def: "A striatum neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Col6a3 (Mmus), Slco1c1 (Mmus), Plekhd1 (Mmus), Igfbpl1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LSX Sall3 Lmo1 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Plekhd1, Igfbpl1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Slc32a1, Gad2). These cells are located in the Lateral septal complex, brain , in or close to the regions: Lateral septal nucleus, rostral (rostroventral) part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1178 LSX Sall3 Lmo1 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
