def: "A striatum neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Col6a3 (Mmus), Chst9 (Mmus), Prdm12 (Mmus), Ecel1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LSX Sall3 Lmo1 Gaba_5 cells by expression of 6430628N08Rik, Dchs2. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Lateral septal complex, brain , in or close to the regions: Lateral septal nucleus, rostral (rostroventral) part, Septofimbrial nucleus, columns of the fornix . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1183 LSX Sall3 Lmo1 Gaba_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
