id: PCL:0113618
name: MEA-BST Lhx6 Sp9 Gaba_1 Efemp1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cyp19a1 (Mmus), Nxph2 (Mmus), Efemp1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MEA-BST Lhx6 Sp9 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Efemp1, Cyp19a1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Slc32a1, Gad1, Ddc). These cells are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei , in or close to the regions: Medial amygdalar nucleus, Central amygdalar nucleus, medial part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1238 MEA-BST Lhx6 Sp9 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
