id: PCL:0113678
name: MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_3 Npbwr1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Esr2 (Mmus), Npbwr1 (Mmus), Nxph2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_3 cells by expression of Npbwr1, Calcr. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Bed nuclei of the stria terminalis, Medial amygdalar nucleus, Central amygdalar nucleus, medial part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1298 MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
