id: PCL:0113682
name: MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_4 Tac2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Moxd1 (Mmus), Ppp1r17 (Mmus), Cplx3 (Mmus), Myo1h (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_4 cells by expression of Tac2, Myo1h. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Pallidum, brain , in or close to the regions: Bed nuclei of the stria terminalis, lateral ventricle . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1302 MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
synonym: "1302 MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_4" EXACT []
