id: PCL:0113686
name: MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_5 Colec12 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cyp19a1 (Mmus), Cplx3 (Mmus), Kcng1 (Mmus), Frem3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_5 cells by expression of Colec12, Chodl. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Bed nuclei of the stria terminalis, Medial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1306 MEA-BST Lhx6 Nfib Gaba_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
