def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Adora2a (Mmus), Ccdc192 (Mmus), Col6a1 (Mmus), Pld5 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CEA-AAA-BST Six3 Sp9 Gaba_4 cells by expression of A830036E02Rik, Fras1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Ddc). These cells are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Cortical subplate, Striatum ventral region, Striatum dorsal region, brain , in or close to the regions: Striatum, Caudoputamen, Endopiriform nucleus, ventral part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1367 CEA-AAA-BST Six3 Sp9 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
