id: PCL:0113767
name: CEA-BST Ebf1 Pdyn Gaba_2 Gm13481 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Fst (Mmus), Tac1 (Mmus), Igfbpl1 (Mmus), Gpr149 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CEA-BST Ebf1 Pdyn Gaba_2 cells by expression of Gm13481, Dlk1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Slc32a1, Ddc, Slc18a2, Gad2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Bed nuclei of the stria terminalis, Central amygdalar nucleus, lateral part, Central amygdalar nucleus, medial part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1387 CEA-BST Ebf1 Pdyn Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
