id: PCL:0113834
name: SI-MPO-LPO Lhx8 Gaba_5 Abca4 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lhx8 (Mmus), Abca4 (Mmus), A730046J19Rik (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SI-MPO-LPO Lhx8 Gaba_5 cells by expression of Abca4, A730046J19Rik. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: Lateral preoptic area, Striatum . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1454 SI-MPO-LPO Lhx8 Gaba_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, SI-MPO-LPO Lhx8 Gaba_5 Abca4 does not have cells in substantia innominata (SI). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1454 SI-MPO-LPO Lhx8 Gaba_5" EXACT []
