[Term]
id: PCL:0113865
name: MPN-MPO-LPO Lhx6 Zfhx3 Gaba_1 Sulf1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cyp19a1 (Mmus), Crhbp (Mmus), Dgkk (Mmus), Chst8 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MPN-MPO-LPO Lhx6 Zfhx3 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Sulf1, Greb1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Ddc). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Striatum-like amygdalar nuclei , in or close to the regions: Medial preoptic nucleus, Medial preoptic area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1485 MPN-MPO-LPO Lhx6 Zfhx3 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, MPN-MPO-LPO Lhx6 Zfhx3 Gaba_1 Sulf1 does not have cells in lateral preoptic area (LPO). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
