id: PCL:0113871
name: MPN-MPO-LPO Lhx6 Zfhx3 Gaba_2 Zfp831 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lhx6 (Mmus), Chst9 (Mmus), Ntsr1 (Mmus), Gm41414 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MPN-MPO-LPO Lhx6 Zfhx3 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Zfp831. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Medial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1491 MPN-MPO-LPO Lhx6 Zfhx3 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
