def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Insm2 (Mmus), Pgm5 (Mmus), Ucp2 (Mmus), Adamts18 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVR Six3 Sox3 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Adamts2, Pgm5. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, preoptic part, Medial preoptic nucleus, Ventromedial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1510 PVR Six3 Sox3 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
