name: PVR Six3 Sox3 Gaba_3 Tac2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of A230108P19Rik (Mmus), Tac2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVR Six3 Sox3 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Tac2. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Ddc). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Medial preoptic nucleus, Anterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1512 PVR Six3 Sox3 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
