def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of A730046J19Rik (Mmus), Prkcd (Mmus), Otof (Mmus), Ecel1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other BST-MPN Six3 Nrgn Gaba cells by expression of C130074G19Rik, A730046J19Rik. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Bed nuclei of the stria terminalis, Medial preoptic nucleus, Medial preoptic area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1540 BST-MPN Six3 Nrgn Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
