id: PCL:0113942
name: BST-MPN Six3 Nrgn Gaba_6 Apoc3 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sytl4 (Mmus), Cyp19a1 (Mmus), Six3 (Mmus), Gal (Mmus). It is distinguished from other BST-MPN Six3 Nrgn Gaba_6 cells by expression of Apoc3, Gal. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Ddc). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Bed nuclei of the stria terminalis, Medial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1562 BST-MPN Six3 Nrgn Gaba_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
