def: "A histaminergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Hdc (Mmus), Scgn (Mmus), Gfral (Mmus), Tmem26 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other TMv-PMv Tbx3 Hist-Gaba_1 cells by expression of Adgrg6, Gfral. It is histaminergic (inferred from expression of Slc32a1, Ddc, Hdc, Slc18a2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Ventromedial hypothalamic nucleus, Dorsomedial nucleus of the hypothalamus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1574 TMv-PMv Tbx3 Hist-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
