id: PCL:0113979
name: RT-ZI Gnb3 Gaba_4 Foxp2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cd36 (Mmus), Sp8 (Mmus), Col6a4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other RT-ZI Gnb3 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Foxp2, Gal. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Thalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Parasubthalamic nucleus, Zona incerta . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1599 RT-ZI Gnb3 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
