id: PCL:0113999
name: DMH Prdm13 Gaba_1 Six3 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Prdm13 (Mmus), Gpr50 (Mmus), Sytl4 (Mmus), Gda (Mmus). It is distinguished from other DMH Prdm13 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Six3, Gda. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, intermediate part, Dorsomedial nucleus of the hypothalamus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1619 DMH Prdm13 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
