id: PCL:0114025
name: PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_4 Ttn GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cd79a (Mmus), Insm2 (Mmus), Gpr83 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Ttn. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Slc32a1, Gad1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, preoptic part, Subparaventricular zone, Medial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1645 PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_4 Ttn does not have cells in paraventricular hypothalamic nucleus, descending division (PVHd). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1645 PVHd-SBPV Six3 Prox1 Gaba_4" EXACT []
