name: AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_3 Vegfc GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of C1ql2 (Mmus), Isl1 (Mmus), Kcns3 (Mmus), Vegfc (Mmus). It is distinguished from other AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Vegfc, C1ql2, Npffr1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Anterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1658 AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_3 Vegfc does not have cells in subparaventricular zone (SBPV), paraventricular hypothalamic nucleus, descending division (PVHd). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1658 AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_3" EXACT []
