def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Kcnj5 (Mmus), Qrfpr (Mmus), Zic3 (Mmus), Six3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_5 cells by expression of Sema3e, Rorb. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Subparaventricular zone, Medial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1668 AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
