[Term]
id: PCL:0114052
name: AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6 Cckar neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Aldh1a3 (Mmus), Cckar (Mmus), Gal (Mmus). It is distinguished from other AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6 cells by expression of Cckar, Gal. It is dopaminergic (inferred from expression of Slc32a1, Ddc, Th, Slc18a2, Gad2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Anterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1672 AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6 Cckar does not have cells in subparaventricular zone (SBPV), paraventricular hypothalamic nucleus, descending division (PVHd). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "1672 AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6" EXACT []
