def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Prdm12 (Mmus), Klhl14 (Mmus), Nts (Mmus), Isl1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6 cells by expression of Nts, Klhl14. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Ddc). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Zona incerta, Anterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1675 AHN-SBPV-PVHd Pdrm12 Gaba_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
