id: PCL:0114075
name: SBPV-PVa Six6 Satb2 Gaba_3 Gpr149 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Six6 (Mmus), Gm10754 (Mmus), Satb2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SBPV-PVa Six6 Satb2 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Gpr149. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Paraventricular hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1695 SBPV-PVa Six6 Satb2 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
