[Term]
id: PCL:0114094
name: ZI Pax6 Gaba_1 Col6a6 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm30551 (Mmus), Col6a6 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other ZI Pax6 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Col6a6. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Thalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Zona incerta, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1714 ZI Pax6 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
