def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm4881 (Mmus), Prdm12 (Mmus), Pde11a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other ZI Pax6 Gaba_6 cells by expression of Cdc14a. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Slc32a1, Gad1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1753 ZI Pax6 Gaba_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
