id: PCL:0114137
name: ZI Pax6 Gaba_6 Rspo3 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm4881 (Mmus), Pax6 (Mmus), Tshr (Mmus), Rspo3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other ZI Pax6 Gaba_6 cells by expression of Tshr, Rspo3. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Slc32a1, Ddc, Slc18a2, Gad2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Zona incerta, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1757 ZI Pax6 Gaba_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
