[Term]
id: PCL:0114278
name: PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_2 Brs3 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Brs3 (Mmus), Plekhg1 (Mmus), Cd24a (Mmus), Gm27199 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Brs3, Cd24a, Gm27199, Fzd5. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: Ventromedial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1898 PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
