id: PCL:0114284
name: PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_3 Hmcn1 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Edar (Mmus), Npy (Mmus), Hmcn1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Hmcn1. It is dopaminergic (inferred from expression of Slc32a1, Ddc, Th, Slc18a2, Gad2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, preoptic part, Medial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1904 PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
