id: PCL:0114287
name: PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_3 Npy neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ush1c (Mmus), Ctxn3 (Mmus), Cyp19a1 (Mmus), Stk32b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Npy, Gm29683. It is dopaminergic (inferred from expression of Slc32a1, Ddc, Th, Slc18a2, Gad2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, preoptic part, Ventromedial preoptic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1907 PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
