def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sytl4 (Mmus), Qrfprl (Mmus), Cartpt (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_5 cells by expression of A730046J19Rik, Cckar. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Slc32a1, Ddc, Slc18a2, Gad2, Gad1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Periventricular hypothalamic nucleus, preoptic part, Medial preoptic nucleus, Vascular organ of the lamina terminalis . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1913 PVpo-VMPO-MPN Hmx2 Gaba_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
