id: PCL:0114336
name: DMH Hmx2 Gaba_5 Islr2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Hmx2 (Mmus), Nts (Mmus), Foxp2 (Mmus), Ptger4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other DMH Hmx2 Gaba_5 cells by expression of Islr2, Bcl11a, Arhgap36. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:1956 DMH Hmx2 Gaba_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
