id: PCL:0114384
name: MEA-COA-BMA Ccdc42 Glut_2 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ccdc42 (Mmus), Mafb (Mmus), Adcyap1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MEA-COA-BMA Ccdc42 Glut cells by expression of Mafb. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas, Cortical subplate , in or close to the regions: Basomedial amygdalar nucleus, anterior part, Cortical amygdalar area, anterior part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2004 MEA-COA-BMA Ccdc42 Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
