def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vmn1r200 (Mmus), C1ql1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other COAa-PAA-MEA Barhl2 Glut_6 cells by expression of Vmn1r200, Prokr2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Olfactory areas, Cortical subplate , in or close to the regions: Piriform area, Endopiriform nucleus, ventral part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2038 COAa-PAA-MEA Barhl2 Glut_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: This type COAa-PAA-MEA Barhl2 Glut_6 Vmn1r200 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for cortical amygdalar area, anterior part (COAa), piriform-amygdalar area (PAA), medial amygdalar nucleus (MEA). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "2038 COAa-PAA-MEA Barhl2 Glut_6" EXACT []
