def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Chrna2 (Mmus), Col6a3 (Mmus), Rxfp3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_1 cells by expression of Chrna2, Glp1r, Rxfp3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Magnocellular nucleus, Substantia innominata . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2145 SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_1 Chrna2 does not have cells in lateral preoptic area (LPO), lateral hypothalamic area (LHA). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "2145 SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_1" EXACT []
