def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dmrta2 (Mmus), Fst (Mmus), Atp6ap1l (Mmus), Cntn6 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_2 cells by expression of Atp6ap1l, Dmrta2, Fign. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Striatum ventral region, Olfactory areas, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Magnocellular nucleus, Substantia innominata . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2154 SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
