name: SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_7 Egflam glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dmrta2 (Mmus), Egflam (Mmus), Wnt7b (Mmus), Nts (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_7 cells by expression of Egflam, Pou6f2, Galr1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Gad2). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Substantia innominata . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2196 SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_7." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
