id: PCL:0114582
name: SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_8 Scn11a glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Scn11a (Mmus), Dmrta2 (Mmus), Htr1b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_8 cells by expression of Scn11a, Dmrta2, Chrm2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Gad2). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus, Striatum ventral region, Pallidum , in or close to the regions: Lateral preoptic area, Substantia innominata, Bed nuclei of the stria terminalis, Nucleus accumbens . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2202 SI-MA-LPO-LHA Skor1 Glut_8." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
