id: PCL:0114665
name: DMH-LHA Vgll2 Glut_1 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vgll2 (Mmus), Mdfic (Mmus). It is distinguished from other DMH-LHA Vgll2 Glut cells by expression of Bnc2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Ddc). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Paraventricular hypothalamic nucleus, descending division . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2285 DMH-LHA Vgll2 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
