def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Bsx (Mmus), Npas1 (Mmus), Penk (Mmus), Tac2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PH-ant-LHA Otp Bsx Glut_3 cells by expression of Tac2, Ebf3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Gad2). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Tuberal nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2401 PH-ant-LHA Otp Bsx Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
