def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ube2u (Mmus), Barhl1 (Mmus), C1ql1 (Mmus), Irs4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PMv-TMv Pitx2 Glut_1 cells by expression of Adamts19, C1ql1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Ventromedial hypothalamic nucleus, Dorsomedial nucleus of the hypothalamus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2463 PMv-TMv Pitx2 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: This type PMv-TMv Pitx2 Glut_1 Adamts19 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for ventral premammillary nucleus (PMv), tuberomammillary nucleus, ventral part (TMv). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "2463 PMv-TMv Pitx2 Glut_1" EXACT []
