def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Nkx2-4 (Mmus), Col24a1 (Mmus), Crb1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PH-an Pitx2 Glut_2 cells by expression of Col24a1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Gad2). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Posterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2478 PH-an Pitx2 Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
