id: PCL:0114859
name: PH-an Pitx2 Glut_2 Gpr139 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Nkx2-4 (Mmus), Pax7 (Mmus), Gm13986 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PH-an Pitx2 Glut_2 cells by expression of Gpr139. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2479 PH-an Pitx2 Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
