def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Foxb1 (Mmus), Parvg (Mmus), Rspo2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PMd-LHA Foxb1 Glut_1 cells by expression of Gpr101, Rspo2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Hypothalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral hypothalamic area, Tuberal nucleus, Posterior hypothalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2523 PMd-LHA Foxb1 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
