[Term]
id: PCL:0114964
name: MH Tac2 Glut_2 Aga glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cytip (Mmus), Onecut1 (Mmus), Ddc (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MH Tac2 Glut_2 cells by expression of Aga. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Ddc, Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Thalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: Medial habenula, habenular commissure . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2584 MH Tac2 Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
