name: LH Pou4f1 Sox1 Glut_1 Syndig1 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gng8 (Mmus), Megf11 (Mmus), Sox1ot (Mmus), Htr1b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LH Pou4f1 Sox1 Glut_1 cells by expression of Syndig1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Gad2). These cells are located in the Thalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: Lateral habenula, Medial habenula, stria medullaris . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2599 LH Pou4f1 Sox1 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
