[Term]
id: PCL:0114988
name: LH Pou4f1 Sox1 Glut_3 Nfib glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gpr151 (Mmus), Pmfbp1 (Mmus), Robo3 (Mmus), Gm20063 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LH Pou4f1 Sox1 Glut_3 cells by expression of Nfib, Robo3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Ddc). These cells are located in the Thalamus , in or close to the regions: Lateral habenula . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2608 LH Pou4f1 Sox1 Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
