def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm28822 (Mmus), Alpk2 (Mmus), Igkc (Mmus), Lrrtm4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CM-IAD-CL-PCN Sema5b Glut_1 cells by expression of Alpk2, Mrvi1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Thalamus , in or close to the regions: Mediodorsal nucleus of thalamus, Central lateral nucleus of the thalamus, Paracentral nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2633 CM-IAD-CL-PCN Sema5b Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
