comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: This type CUN Evx2 Lhx2 Glut_4 Ltbp1 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for cuneiform nucleus (CUN). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "2834 CUN Evx2 Lhx2 Glut_4" EXACT []
