def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm28653 (Mmus), C1ql4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MRN Pou3f1 C1ql4 Glut_1 cells by expression of Gm28653. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Gad2). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, Lateral hypothalamic area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2887 MRN Pou3f1 C1ql4 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
