def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Tfap2d (Mmus), Gm32828 (Mmus), Tfap2b (Mmus), Irx2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MRN Pou3f1 C1ql4 Glut_3 cells by expression of Tfap2b, Scn4b. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate white layer, Anterior pretectal nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2896 MRN Pou3f1 C1ql4 Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
