def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gbx2 (Mmus), Adgrg2 (Mmus), Sox5 (Mmus), Foxp2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_3 cells by expression of Adgrg2, Angpt1, Otof. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Thalamus , in or close to the regions: Nucleus of reuniens, Subparafascicular area, Intermediodorsal nucleus of the thalamus, Paraventricular nucleus of the thalamus, Xiphoid thalamic nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:2949 SPA-SPFm-SPFp-POL-PIL-PoT Sp9 Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
