id: PCL:0115449
name: PAG-MRN Tfap2b Glut_1 Ppp1r17 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Rapsn (Mmus), Crhr2 (Mmus), Qrfprl (Mmus), Htr1b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PAG-MRN Tfap2b Glut_1 cells by expression of Ppp1r17, Qrfprl, Htr1b. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Cerebellum , in or close to the regions: Periaqueductal gray, Lobule III . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3069 PAG-MRN Tfap2b Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
