[Term]
id: PCL:0115565
name: PAG Pou4f2 Mesi2 Glut_2 Pde11a glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pou4f2 (Mmus), Glis3 (Mmus), Qrfprl (Mmus), En1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PAG Pou4f2 Mesi2 Glut_2 cells by expression of Pde11a, Gli3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: cerebral aqueduct, Periaqueductal gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3185 PAG Pou4f2 Mesi2 Glut_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
