def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Plscr5 (Mmus), Cartpt (Mmus), Ccn3 (Mmus), Wnt5a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCig Foxb1 Glut_4 cells by expression of Npas1, Sox5. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, motor related, deep gray layer, Periaqueductal gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3236 SCig Foxb1 Glut_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: This type SCig Foxb1 Glut_4 Npas1 does not have cells in any of the regions it is named for superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate gray layer (SCig). The name merely indicates that it is a subtype of more general transcriptomic type that does. This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "3236 SCig Foxb1 Glut_4" EXACT []
