name: CUN-PPN Evx2 Meis2 Glut_1 Adamts12 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gpr50 (Mmus), A530065N20Rik (Mmus), Lepr (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CUN-PPN Evx2 Meis2 Glut_1 cells by expression of Adamts12. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Gad2). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Cerebellum , in or close to the regions: Cuneiform nucleus, Lobule III . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3320 CUN-PPN Evx2 Meis2 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
