def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Hpse2 (Mmus), C1qtnf7 (Mmus), Shox2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCop Pou4f2 Neurod2 Glut cells by expression of C1qtnf7. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate gray layer, Superior colliculus, superficial gray layer, Superior colliculus, optic layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3360 SCop Pou4f2 Neurod2 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
