id: PCL:0115766
name: PAG-MRN Rln3 Gaba_1 Six3os1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ghrh (Mmus), Ngf (Mmus), Six3os1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PAG-MRN Rln3 Gaba cells by expression of Six3os1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Ddc). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, Periaqueductal gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3386 PAG-MRN Rln3 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
