id: PCL:0115769
name: PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_1 Abi3bp GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pax7 (Mmus), Pappa2 (Mmus), Abi3bp (Mmus), Qrfprl (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Abi3bp, Qrfprl. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Pons , in or close to the regions: Pontine central gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3389 PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
