[Term]
id: PCL:0115775
name: PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_2 Myo5b GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gm4881 (Mmus), Pax7 (Mmus), Slc17a6 (Mmus), Dlk1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Myo5b, Mab21l2. It is glutamatergic and GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Pedunculopontine nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3395 PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
