id: PCL:0115779
name: PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_2 Nr4a2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pax7 (Mmus), Pax8 (Mmus), Fzd1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Nr4a2, Pax5. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Pons , in or close to the regions: Pedunculopontine nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3399 PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
