id: PCL:0115787
name: PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_3 Cd109 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cd109 (Mmus), Pax7 (Mmus), Qrfprl (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Cd109, Qrfprl. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Cerebellum, Pons , in or close to the regions: Periaqueductal gray, Parabrachial nucleus, Lobule II . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3407 PPN-CUN-PCG Otp En1 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
