name: MRN-PPN-CUN Pax8 Gaba_2 Galnt15 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pax8 (Mmus), Onecut1 (Mmus), Galnt15 (Mmus), Irx2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MRN-PPN-CUN Pax8 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Galnt15, Ebf3. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Cerebellum, brain , in or close to the regions: cerebral aqueduct, Periaqueductal gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3416 MRN-PPN-CUN Pax8 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
