def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 6430710C18Rik (Mmus), Hepacam2 (Mmus), Cntnap3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SNr-VTA Pax5 Npas1 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Cntnap3, 6430710C18Rik. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Substantia nigra, reticular part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3433 SNr-VTA Pax5 Npas1 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, SNr-VTA Pax5 Npas1 Gaba_1 Cntnap3 does not have cells in ventral tegmental area (VTA). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "3433 SNr-VTA Pax5 Npas1 Gaba_1" EXACT []
