id: PCL:0115815
name: SNr-VTA Pax5 Npas1 Gaba_1 Gpr101 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Col24a1 (Mmus), Gata3 (Mmus), Pxdc1 (Mmus), Btc (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SNr-VTA Pax5 Npas1 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Gpr101, Fstl4, Prlr. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Substantia nigra, compact part, Substantia nigra, reticular part, Ventral tegmental area . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3435 SNr-VTA Pax5 Npas1 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
