id: PCL:0115842
name: SNr Six3 Gaba_1 Adamts19 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 9130008F23Rik (Mmus), Gata3 (Mmus), Rxrg (Mmus), Npas1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SNr Six3 Gaba cells by expression of Adamts19, Npas1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, brain , in or close to the regions: Substantia nigra, reticular part, cerebal peduncle . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3462 SNr Six3 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
