def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cd40 (Mmus), Ttn (Mmus), Il20ra (Mmus). It is distinguished from other IC Six3 En2 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Il20ra, Ttn. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Cerebellum . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3493 IC Six3 En2 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
