id: PCL:0115885
name: IC Six3 En2 Gaba_6 Cartpt GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc26a7 (Mmus), Trh (Mmus), Six3 (Mmus), Penk (Mmus). It is distinguished from other IC Six3 En2 Gaba_6 cells by expression of Cartpt, Penk. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Cerebellum , in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, Cuneiform nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3505 IC Six3 En2 Gaba_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
