id: PCL:0115961
name: PAG-RN Nkx2-2 Otx1 Gaba_3 Emx1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Otx1 (Mmus), Tfap2b (Mmus), Lhfp (Mmus), Hmcn1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PAG-RN Nkx2-2 Otx1 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Emx1, Lhfp. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Slc6a5). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Pedunculopontine nucleus, Midbrain reticular nucleus, Periaqueductal gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3581 PAG-RN Nkx2-2 Otx1 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
