id: PCL:0115977
name: PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_1 Irx3 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Onecut3 (Mmus), Sox14 (Mmus), Tll1 (Mmus), Irx3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Irx3. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, Periaqueductal gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3597 PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
