id: PCL:0116001
name: PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_3 Scn4b GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Otx1 (Mmus), Pvalb (Mmus), Nr4a2 (Mmus), Ddc (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Scn4b, Ddc. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Ddc). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Anterior pretectal nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3621 PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
