[Term]
id: PCL:0116012
name: PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_5 Prkcq GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Otx1 (Mmus), Npy (Mmus), Gm29683 (Mmus), Il1rapl2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_5 cells by expression of Prkcq, Htr1f. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, Anterior pretectal nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3632 PRT Tcf7l2 Gaba_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
