name: LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_4 Serpina3g GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Serpina3g (Mmus), Sox14 (Mmus), Drd2 (Mmus), Slc32a1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_4 cells by expression of Serpina3g, Drd2. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Hippocampal region, Thalamus , in or close to the regions: Ventral part of the lateral geniculate complex, Intergeniculate leaflet of the lateral geniculate complex, auditory radiation, Dorsal part of the lateral geniculate complex, core . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3653 LGv-SPFp-SPFm Nkx2-2 Tcf7l2 Gaba_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
