def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cdh23 (Mmus), Met (Mmus), Otx2os1 (Mmus), Foxp2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCm-PAG Cdh23 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Met, Epha3. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate gray layer, Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate white layer, Superior colliculus, motor related, deep gray layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3710 SCm-PAG Cdh23 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, SCm-PAG Cdh23 Gaba_2 Met does not have cells in periaqueductal gray (PAG). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "3710 SCm-PAG Cdh23 Gaba_2" EXACT []
