def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pax7 (Mmus), Egflam (Mmus), Pla2g5 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SC Lef1 Otx2 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Egflam. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate gray layer, Superior colliculus, zonal layer, Superior colliculus, superficial gray layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3743 SC Lef1 Otx2 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
