id: PCL:0116149
name: PRT Mecom Gaba_1 Sost GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Sost (Mmus), Mecom (Mmus), Casz1 (Mmus), Lancl3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PRT Mecom Gaba_1 cells by expression of Sost, Casz1, Lancl3. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, brain , in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, Anterior pretectal nucleus, brachium of the superior colliculus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3769 PRT Mecom Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
