name: PRT Mecom Gaba_3 Myocd GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Mecom (Mmus), Myocd (Mmus), Pax7 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PRT Mecom Gaba_3 cells by expression of Myocd, Pax7. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Slc6a5). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Posterior pretectal nucleus, Midbrain reticular nucleus, Anterior pretectal nucleus, Nucleus of the optic tract . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3774 PRT Mecom Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
