def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pax7 (Mmus), C1ql1 (Mmus), Syt2 (Mmus), Itga8 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCs Lef1 Gli3 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Npr3, Nell1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, motor related, intermediate gray layer, Inferior colliculus, dorsal nucleus, Superior colliculus, superficial gray layer, Superior colliculus, optic layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3793 SCs Lef1 Gli3 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
