id: PCL:0116181
name: SCsg Gabrr2 Gaba_1 Hmcn1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ankrd31 (Mmus), Dmbx1 (Mmus), Zic5 (Mmus), Car10 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCsg Gabrr2 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Rreb1, Hmcn1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Thalamus , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, superficial gray layer, Superior colliculus, optic layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3801 SCsg Gabrr2 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
