[Term]
id: PCL:0116187
name: SCsg Gabrr2 Gaba_1 Gulp1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 4933429O19Rik (Mmus), Cartpt (Mmus), Sst (Mmus), Col25a1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SCsg Gabrr2 Gaba_1 cells by expression of Sst, Gulp1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain, brain , in or close to the regions: Superior colliculus, zonal layer, Superior colliculus, superficial gray layer . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3807 SCsg Gabrr2 Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
