def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Il20ra (Mmus), Crh (Mmus), Esr1 (Mmus), Abi3bp (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PB Lmx1a Glut_4 cells by expression of Crhbp, Abi3bp, Esr1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Chat). These cells are located in the Pons , in or close to the regions: Koelliker-Fuse subnucleus, Parabrachial nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3936 PB Lmx1a Glut_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
