id: PCL:0116323
name: PB Lmx1a Glut_4 Chat glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Chat (Mmus), Cd36 (Mmus), Bmp3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PB Lmx1a Glut_4 cells by expression of Ppp1r17, Chat, Irx4. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Chat). These cells are located in the Cerebellum, Pons , in or close to the regions: Parabrachial nucleus, Lobule III . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:3943 PB Lmx1a Glut_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
synonym: "3943 PB Lmx1a Glut_4" EXACT []
