id: PCL:0116394
name: LDT-PCG Vsx2 Lhx4 Glut_7 Chrdl1 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Lhx4 (Mmus), Chrdl1 (Mmus), Gm39185 (Mmus), Ecel1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LDT-PCG Vsx2 Lhx4 Glut_7 cells by expression of Chrdl1, Cbln2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Gad2, Ddc). These cells are located in the Pons , in or close to the regions: Laterodorsal tegmental nucleus, Parabrachial nucleus, Pontine central gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4014 LDT-PCG Vsx2 Lhx4 Glut_7." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
