def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Runx1 (Mmus), Gldn (Mmus), Evx1os (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PB Evx2 Glut_3 cells by expression of Runx1, Mc4r. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Pons , in or close to the regions: Cuneiform nucleus, Parabrachial nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4043 PB Evx2 Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
