def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of C1ql4 (Mmus), Pon3 (Mmus), Pvalb (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PB Evx2 Glut_9 cells by expression of Coch, Pon3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Pons , in or close to the regions: Midbrain reticular nucleus, superior cerebelar peduncles, Parabrachial nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4084 PB Evx2 Glut_9." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
