[Term]
id: PCL:0116474
name: B-PB Nr4a2 Glut_1 Cd44 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of C1ql4 (Mmus), Cd44 (Mmus), Gda (Mmus), Epha4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other B-PB Nr4a2 Glut_1 cells by expression of Cd44, Cd24a. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Ddc). These cells are located in the Pons, brain , in or close to the regions: lateral lemniscus, arbor vitae, ventral spinocerebellar tract, Parabrachial nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4094 B-PB Nr4a2 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
