name: PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1 Megf10 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Iqcf3 (Mmus), Phox2b (Mmus), Gpsm3 (Mmus), Gda (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1 cells by expression of Megf10, Drd2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Pons , in or close to the regions: Supratrigeminal nucleus, Parabrachial nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4157 PB-NTS Phox2b Ebf3 Lmx1b Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
