id: PCL:0116703
name: PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_1 Sox9 neuron (Mmus)
def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ctcflos (Mmus), Hoxb8 (Mmus), St18 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_1 cells by expression of Sox9, Hoxc6. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4323 PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
