id: PCL:0116775
name: PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_6 Abca13 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Abca13 (Mmus), Gm765 (Mmus), Dsg2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_6 cells by expression of Phox2b, Abca13. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Medulla , in or close to the regions: Spinal nucleus of the trigeminal, oral part, Parvicellular reticular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4395 PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_6." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
