id: PCL:0116783
name: PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_7 Phox2b glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Phox2b (Mmus), Onecut3 (Mmus), Bcl11b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_7 cells by expression of Phox2b, Ebf3. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Medulla, Pons , in or close to the regions: Spinal nucleus of the trigeminal, oral part, Supratrigeminal nucleus, Parvicellular reticular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4403 PGRN-PARN-MDRN Hoxb5 Glut_7." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
