def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of A730036I17Rik (Mmus), Phox2b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MV-SPIV Phox2b Ebf3 Lbx1 Glut cells by expression of 4930545L08Rik. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Slc32a1, Th). These cells are located in the Medulla, brain , in or close to the regions: choroid plexus, Medial vestibular nucleus, Spinal vestibular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4489 MV-SPIV Phox2b Ebf3 Lbx1 Glut_5." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
