def: "A neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gpx2 (Mmus), Speer4cos (Mmus), H2-Ab1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MV-SPIV Zic4 Neurod2 Glut_3 cells by expression of H2-Ab1, Sfrp2. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Chat, Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Medulla, brain , in or close to the regions: choroid plexus, fourth ventricle, Medial vestibular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4507 MV-SPIV Zic4 Neurod2 Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
