[Term]
id: PCL:0116893
name: MV-SPIV Zic4 Neurod2 Glut_4 Chrnb4 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Aldh1a2 (Mmus), Crabp1 (Mmus), Chrnb4 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MV-SPIV Zic4 Neurod2 Glut_4 cells by expression of Aldh1a2, Chrnb4. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6). These cells are located in the Medulla , in or close to the regions: Medial vestibular nucleus, Spinal vestibular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4513 MV-SPIV Zic4 Neurod2 Glut_4." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
