id: PCL:0116899
name: NTS Aldh1a2 Glut_1 Fibcd1 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Aldh1a2 (Mmus), Fibcd1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NTS Aldh1a2 Glut cells by expression of Fibcd1. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Ddc). These cells are located in the brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4519 NTS Aldh1a2 Glut_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
