[Term]
id: PCL:0116944
name: VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3 Gcnt4 glutamatergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cryba2 (Mmus), Evx1os (Mmus), Tmem132c (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3 cells by expression of Gcnt4. It is glutamatergic (inferred from expression of Slc17a6, Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Medulla, Cerebellum , in or close to the regions: Ventral cochlear nucleus, Flocculus, Dorsal cochlear nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4564 VCO Mafa Meis2 Glut_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
