id: PCL:0116999
name: CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba_3 Gna14 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gpr174 (Mmus), Gna14 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba_3 cells by expression of Gna14. It is glutamatergic and GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Slc17a8). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Pons , in or close to the regions: Interpeduncular nucleus, caudal, Interpeduncular nucleus, apical, Superior central nucleus raphe . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4619 CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba_3 Gna14 does not have cells in nucleus raphe pontis (RPO). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "4619 CS-RPO Meis2 Gaba_3" EXACT []
