id: PCL:0117055
name: CS-PRNr-PCG Tmem163 Otp Gaba_1 Nkx1-2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Nkx1-2 (Mmus), Dkk2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CS-PRNr-PCG Tmem163 Otp Gaba_1 cells by expression of Nkx1-2, Tafa4. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Slc18a2). These cells are located in the Midbrain, Pons , in or close to the regions: Interpeduncular nucleus, caudal, Interpeduncular nucleus, intermediate, Superior central nucleus raphe, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4675 CS-PRNr-PCG Tmem163 Otp Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
