[Term]
id: PCL:0117152
name: LDT-PCG St18 Gaba_2 Man1a GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Otp (Mmus), Chrdl1 (Mmus), Etv1 (Mmus), Dchs2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other LDT-PCG St18 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Man1a. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Slc32a1, Gad1). These cells are located in the Pons , in or close to the regions: Laterodorsal tegmental nucleus, Pontine central gray . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4772 LDT-PCG St18 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
