id: PCL:0117159
name: DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_2 Ano1 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vmn1r207-ps (Mmus), Tacr3 (Mmus), Plcb1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Ano1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Midbrain , in or close to the regions: Interpeduncular nucleus, caudal, Interpeduncular nucleus, intermediate . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4779 DTN-LDT-IPN Otp Pax3 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
