def: "A GABA-Gly neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Ikzf1 (Mmus), Prrxl1 (Mmus), Cntnap5b (Mmus). It is distinguished from other GRN-IRN-MDRNd Ikzf1 Gly-Gaba cells by expression of Cntnap5b. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc6a5, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4844 GRN-IRN-MDRNd Ikzf1 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
