name: MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_1 Slitrk6 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dmbx1 (Mmus), Tshr (Mmus), Slitrk6 (Mmus), Grin3a (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_1 cells by expression of Slitrk6, Grin3a. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1, Slc6a5). These cells are located in the Medulla , in or close to the regions: Spinal vestibular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4942 MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
