def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Dmbx1 (Mmus), Bmp4 (Mmus), Tpbg (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_1 cells by expression of Bmp4, Tpbg. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Slc6a5). These cells are located in the Medulla , in or close to the regions: Medial vestibular nucleus, Spinal vestibular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4945 MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions. Warning: Despite its name, MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_1 Tpbg does not have cells in nucleus prepositus (PRP). This assertion is based on data from registration to a reference standard common co-ordinate framework and parcelation scheme.
synonym: "4945 MV-SPIV-PRP Dmbx1 Gly-Gaba_1" EXACT []
