id: PCL:0117336
name: MDRNd Prox1 Pax6 Gly-Gaba_1 Otp GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Vdr (Mmus), Foxd3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MDRNd Prox1 Pax6 Gly-Gaba cells by expression of Otp. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc6a5, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4956 MDRNd Prox1 Pax6 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
