id: PCL:0117339
name: MY Prox1 Lmo7 Gly-Gaba_1 Pax3 GABA-Gly neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABA-Gly neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of 5033406O09Rik (Mmus), Pax3 (Mmus), Bche (Mmus). It is distinguished from other MY Prox1 Lmo7 Gly-Gaba cells by expression of Pax3. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Slc6a5). These cells are located in the Medulla, Pons , in or close to the regions: Medial vestibular nucleus, Parabrachial nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:4959 MY Prox1 Lmo7 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
