id: PCL:0117384
name: RPA Pax6 Hoxb5 Gly-Gaba_1 Syt2 GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Pdzk1ip1 (Mmus), Hoxa5 (Mmus), Syt2 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other RPA Pax6 Hoxb5 Gly-Gaba cells by expression of Syt2, Pdzk1ip1. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc32a1, Slc6a5). These cells are located in the Medulla, brain , in or close to the regions: Gigantocellular reticular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5004 RPA Pax6 Hoxb5 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
