id: PCL:0117424
name: PARN-MDRNd-NTS Gbx2 Gly-Gaba_3 Slc5a7 GABA-Gly neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABA-Gly neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Hoxa5 (Mmus), Tnfaip8l3 (Mmus), Adamts12 (Mmus), Vcan (Mmus). It is distinguished from other PARN-MDRNd-NTS Gbx2 Gly-Gaba_3 cells by expression of Slc5a7, Pnoc. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Slc32a1, Slc6a5, Gad1). These cells are located in the Medulla, brain , in or close to the regions: Nucleus of the solitary tract, Parvicellular reticular nucleus . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5044 PARN-MDRNd-NTS Gbx2 Gly-Gaba_3." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
