def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Zbtb42 (Mmus), Adgrg6 (Mmus), Gipr (Mmus), Gnasas1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other NTS-PARN Neurod2 Gly-Gaba_1 cells by expression of Hspb8, Rxfp3, Slc5a7. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1, Slc6a5). These cells are located in the Medulla, brain , in or close to the regions: Area postrema . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5075 NTS-PARN Neurod2 Gly-Gaba_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
