id: PCL:0117537
name: SPVI-SPVC Sall3 Lhx1 Gly-Gaba_2 Npy2r GABAergic neuron (Mmus)
def: "A GABAergic neuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Cdh3 (Mmus), Met (Mmus), Bmp3 (Mmus), Pnoc (Mmus). It is distinguished from other SPVI-SPVC Sall3 Lhx1 Gly-Gaba_2 cells by expression of Npy2r, Nppc. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Slc32a1, Gad1, Slc6a5). These cells are located in the Medulla, brain , in or close to the regions: Spinal nucleus of the trigeminal, interpolar part . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5157 SPVI-SPVC Sall3 Lhx1 Gly-Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
