name: CB PLI Gly-Gaba_2 Chrnb3 Lugaro cell (Mmus)
def: "A Lugaro cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Mybpc3 (Mmus), Chrnb3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CB PLI Gly-Gaba_2 cells by expression of Chrnb3. It is GABAergic and glycinergic (inferred from expression of Gad2, Gad1, Slc6a5, Slc32a1). These cells are located in the Cerebellum, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5180 CB PLI Gly-Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
