id: PCL:0117571
name: CBX MLI Megf11 Gaba_2 Gabra6 molecular layer interneuron (Mmus)
def: "A molecular layer interneuron of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Gabra6 (Mmus), Nxph1 (Mmus), Pvalb (Mmus). It is distinguished from other CBX MLI Megf11 Gaba_2 cells by expression of Gabra6, Nxph1. It is GABAergic (inferred from expression of Gad1, Gad2, Slc32a1, Slc17a7). These cells are located in the Cerebellum, brain , in or close to the regions: Simple lobule, Crus 1 . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5191 CBX MLI Megf11 Gaba_2." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
