[Term]
id: PCL:0117617
name: Astroependymal NN_1 Ano1 cell (Mmus)
def: "A cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Aqp4 (Mmus), Ano1 (Mmus), Rspo3 (Mmus), Gjb6 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Astroependymal NN_1 cells by expression of Ano1, Gjb6. These cells are located in the Thalamus, brain , in or close to the regions: third ventricle, Medial habenula . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5237 Astroependymal NN_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
synonym: "5237 Astroependymal NN_1" EXACT []
