[Term]
id: PCL:0117676
name: VLMC NN_1 Prss23 vascular leptomeningeal cell (Mmus)
def: "A vascular leptomeningeal cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Igf2 (Mmus), Tagln (Mmus), Fn1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VLMC NN_1 cells by expression of Prss23. These cells are located in the Cerebellum, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5296 VLMC NN_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
synonym: "5296 VLMC NN_1" EXACT []
