name: VLMC NN_1 Spo11 vascular leptomeningeal cell (Mmus)
def: "A vascular leptomeningeal cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Slc6a20a (Mmus), Sh3gl3 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other VLMC NN_1 cells by expression of Spo11. These cells are located in the brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5297 VLMC NN_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
