def: "A brain pericyte of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Adap2 (Mmus), Kcnj8 (Mmus), Col3a1 (Mmus). It is distinguished from other Peri NN cells by expression of Id3. These cells are located in the Isocortex, Cerebellum, brain . Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Cluster:5305 Peri NN_1." [https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-023-06812-z]
comment: Location is inferred from registration of MerFish Data. Registration may be inaccurate, giving misleading location to adjacent anatomical regions.
synonym: "5305 Peri NN_1" EXACT []
